{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        odd_number = 2 * k - 1\n        total_sum += odd_number ** 2\n    return total_sum"}
