{"task_id": "Mbpp/276", "solution": "import math\n\ndef volume_cylinder(radius, height):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the volume of a right circular cylinder.\n    Raises ValueError if radius or height are not positive.\n    \"\"\"\n    if radius <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Radius must be greater than 0.\")\n    if height <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Height must be greater than 0.\")\n    return math.pi * radius ** 2 * height"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "from math import factorial\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients C(n, k) for a given positive integer n.\n    The sum is computed for k = 0, 2, 4, ..., up to n.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        binomial_coeff = factorial(n) // (factorial(k) * factorial(n - k))\n        total_sum += binomial_coeff\n    return total_sum"}
