{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "import collections\n\ndef validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    Handles negative numbers by considering their absolute value.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_number = str(abs(number))\n    digit_counts = collections.Counter(s_number)\n\n    for digit_char, count in digit_counts.items():\n        digit_value = int(digit_char)\n        if count > digit_value:\n            return False\n    return True"}
