{"task_id": "Mbpp/311", "solution": "def set_left_most_unset_bit(value: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return integer with its leftmost unset bit set.\"\"\"\n    if value == -1:  # All bits are 1\n        return value\n    # Find the position of the most significant 0 bit using bitwise NOT\n    complement = ~value\n    msb_pos = complement.bit_length() - 1\n    mask = 1 << msb_pos\n    return value | mask"}
