{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef Find_Min(list_of_lists: List[List[int]]) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    Resolves ties by returning the first minimal sublist encountered.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return []\n\n    min_sublist = list_of_lists[0]\n    min_len = len(min_sublist)\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists[1:]:\n        if len(sublist) < min_len:\n            min_sublist = sublist\n            min_len = len(sublist)\n\n    return min_sublist"}
