{"task_id": "Mbpp/470", "solution": "from typing import Tuple, Number\n\ndef add_pairwise(input_tuple: Tuple[Number]) -> Tuple[Number]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return a tuple of sums of each adjacent pair in input_tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(input_tuple) < 2:\n        return ()\n    return tuple(input_tuple[i] + input_tuple[i + 1] for i in range(len(input_tuple) - 1))"}
