{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "def find_min_diff(arr, num_elements):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum difference between any two elements in the given array.\n    The function sorts the array and then scans for the smallest adjacent difference.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_arr = sorted(arr)\n    min_difference = float('inf')\n\n    for i in range(1, len(sorted_arr)):\n        current_diff = sorted_arr[i] - sorted_arr[i-1]\n        \n        # Return 0 immediately if duplicate elements are found.\n        if current_diff == 0:\n            return 0\n        \n        min_difference = min(min_difference, current_diff)\n        \n    return min_difference"}
