{"task_id": "Mbpp/796", "solution": "def return_sum(d: dict[str, float]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the sum of all numeric values in the dictionary `d`.\n    If `d` is empty, returns 0. The input dictionary is not modified.\n    \"\"\"\n    total = 0.0\n    for value in d.values():\n        total += value\n    return total"}
